Assignments
Assessment for this class is built around a data analysis project that you will undertake using your choice of one of several datasets that will be provided to you or one approved in consultation with your instructor. You may work by yourself or with one to two other members of the class on this assignment. There will be seven biweekly assignments, each of which will help you create one of the components of the final assignment. The final assignment will consist of a five-minute presentation and a written report.
